  "definition": "Issuance of Retail Vehicle Dealer License",
  "effectiveDate": "2016-01-29",
  "historyNote": "#6663, eff 1-1-98 (from Saf-C 2001.11), EXPIRED: 1-1-06 New. #8569, INTERIM, eff 2-18-06, EXPIRED: 8-17-06 New. #8966, eff 8-23-07; ss by #11028, eff 1-29-16",
